WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.110
"The nation is fallen, yet mountains 
and rivers still exist.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:07.480
In spring, in the city, trees and grasses thrive."

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:12.840
Did Hideyoshi's dream of a united 
nation die along with him?

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.820
What does fate have in store?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.490
A peaceful world at last?

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.670
Or even more warfare?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.200
The Battle of Sekigahara

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.620
ended in victory for Ieyasu's Eastern Army.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.880
Mitsunari, Yoshitsugu, Sakon, and many others

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.880
lost their lives on that battlefield.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.470
Kanetsugu and Yukimura, who had shared 
a vow of righteousness with Mitsunari,

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.860
also faced a time of trials and tribulations.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.730
Kanetsugu and the Uesugi clan's army had to retreat

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:46.560
before their battle with Date's army 
reached a proper conclusion.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.980
Meanwhile, Yukimura was sentenced 
to exile at Kudoyama, in Kishu.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.870
<i>Episode 6</i>

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.870
<i>The Caged Heart</i>

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:54.590
It's so uncomfortable, living with 
folks like that around.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:55.770
I hear ya.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.600
If only that samurai hadn't shown up...

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.330
What it means for you to stay in this world.

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:17.340
Reconsider the meaning of your life.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.670
<i>What meaning is there?</i>

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.070
<i>If I can no longer live as a warrior,</i>

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.640
<i>how am I supposed to live?</i>

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.150
Head for Aizu,

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.450
and inform the Uesugi clan of their sentence.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.070
The Uesugi clan?

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.700
What, you can't do it?

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:54.550
Well, I hear the Uesugi clan would rather 
go to war than submit to the Tokugawa,

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.460
so if you're too scared to go, you don't have to.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.030
That's—

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.470
I shall see to it.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.630
I sure hope you make it back in one piece.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.880
Siding with Mitsunari Ishida,

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:14.520
the Uesugi clan fought Masamune Date's army, 
which was part of the Tokugawa forces.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.430
Nobuyuki made his way to Aizu,

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.530
as the messenger who was to inform 
them of their punishment.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.030
When I first heard of it,

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:37.290
I was afraid they were sending 
some monster here,

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.980
but this guy's a wimp.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.350
Yeah.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.800
What do you think you're doing?!

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.550
Don't leave your post!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.840
S-Sir!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:48.800
B-But do we really need to keep 
such a close eye on him?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.000
You imbecile...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.060
That man is a monster who took 
out thousands of our allies!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:57.560
If something were to happen, 
Lord Tokugawa would skin us alive.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:00.070
Now return to your posts!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.570
A butterfly!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.340
Were you trying to catch that butterfly?

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.590
What bad things did you do?

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.360
My mom was talking about it...

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.080
You were sent here as punishment, right?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.580
Punishment, huh?

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:39.230
I suppose.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.500
Eat this!

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.280
It'll make you feel better.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.390
Isn't that your lunch?

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:53.240
It's all right. I have another one.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.880
I don't know what you did,

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.500
but if you say you're sorry, they'll forgive you.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.460
My mom always does!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.250
Now, eat this and cheer up!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.260
Thank you.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.770
Lord Yukimura, lunch—

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.770
When the sun rises over that mountain, 
it looks really pretty!

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.380
Is that so?

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.770
Hey, kid! What are you doing?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.280
Stay away from that man!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.880
You should go now.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.130
Okay.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.010
Hey—

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.600
You little—

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.520
So feisty.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.320
Open the gates!

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:15.160
Aizu's Uesugi were powerful feudal lords, 
whose fiefdom was worth 1.2 million koku.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:22.120
Nobuyuki found himself face-to-face 
with their chief retainer, Kanetsugu Naoe.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.210
I shall now pronounce the sentence 
for your recent transgressions.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.950
You are to leave Aizu and take 
over the Yonezawa domain.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:36.220
Your income will also be cut from 
1.2 million koku to 300,000.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.160
300,000 koku?!

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:42.390
How are we supposed to live on 
a quarter of what we get now?

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.150
Basically, you're saying you want 
to crush the Uesugi clan.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.010
Justice is on our side!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.400
Ieyasu tried to usurp the Toyotomi clan's power.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.720
What gives him the right to punish us?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.160
We will never agree to this!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.910
We're ready to go to war, in order 
to protect the Uesugi clan!

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.490
If it comes to that,

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:06.670
the Tokugawa clan will do everything 
in their power to crush you.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.810
Then so be it!

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.960
To uphold our sense of justice, we'd gladly die!

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.750
True, that's one way to go about it.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:21.730
But would you make those retainers 
outside take up arms and die?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.360
Is that the Uesugi clan's brand of justice?

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:26.560
In their hands,

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.820
leaders hold the lives of their 
servants and the populace.

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:33.070
And yet, you'd neglect their protection, 
to go to die in battle?

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:35.570
Is that what you call righteousness?

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:41.350
But accepting the Tokugawa clan's demands

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.980
would resign the Uesugi clan 
to a fate worse than death!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.330
It would be utterly humiliating!

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.410
Even so, you must live!

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:49.340
So that you might protect the Uesugi clan.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.700
Lord Nobuyuki, if it were to 
protect the Sanada clan,

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.590
you'd be prepared to make the 
harshest decisions, yes?

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:04.100
I hear Yukimura escaped the death penalty 
and was exiled to Kudoyama instead.

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:07.600
Surely that was only possible because of you.

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:08.920
No.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:12.360
When people were demanding his execution,

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:16.180
I said it would be understandable.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:21.670
I could not let myself be swayed by love for him

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.620
if I were to protect the Sanada clan.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.110
You would go that far?

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.630
That is a leader's responsibility.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.840
Yukimura told me about this before.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.330
Will you fight to the death, six coins in hand?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:45.890
No. My brother will never do that.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.740
In order to defend the soul of the Sanada,

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.810
we must survive, no matter what.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:55.190
Those were my brother's words to me.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.410
Survive, no matter what...

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:04.650
I shall go ask my lord for his decision.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:13.690
<i>Mitsunari...</i>

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:17.060
<i>Am I making the wrong decision?</i>

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.440
Kiyomasa!

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.580
Masanori!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.990
I keep telling you to stay away from 
me when your hair's like that!

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:44.950
H-H-Hey...

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.920
We're talking about the shogunate 
and the title of shogun!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.830
How could he accept it without 
talking to Lord Hideyori?

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:56.960
The Tokugawa are supposed to be the 
Toyotomi clan's retainers, aren't they?!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.720
Is this what we fought Mitsunari for?

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:03.940
We promised Lady Nene

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:07.720
that we would protect the world full 
of smiles our lord left behind!

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:13.120
I'm sure Lord Ieyasu will eventually relinquish 
the post of shogun to Lord Hideyori.

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:14.730
He'd better...

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.390
This is a nice place.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.550
The kids are all lovely, too.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:31.750
But staying here forever?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.530
If we stay here, Lord Yukimura will—

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.670
Why so blue?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.010
Lady Nene!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.310
I went to Sekigahara.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.860
Is that Lord Mitsunari's?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.900
Yes.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.400
Lord Tadakatsu,

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.840
why was Yukimura Sanada pardoned?

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.850
Naomasa,

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.080
that matter has already been settled.

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:18.380
If I had been at the council, he'd never 
have gotten away with mere exile!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.530
How are your wounds?

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:21.980
I'm fine...

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.540
Yukimura stalled Lord Hidetada's 
troops with a tiny army.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:29.390
And at Odawara, he charged in 
alone and was victorious.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.890
He's too dangerous to be left alive!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.650
This was our lord's decision.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.280
Focus on healing your wounds.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.730
We mustn't leave Yukimura alive!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:58.740
I thought it would make Mitsunari 
happy for you to keep it.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.860
I'm sorry,

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.420
but I have no right to take it.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.430
Starting now, what will you do?

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.410
When I saw how tranquil life 
was here, in Kudoyama,

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:19.940
I realized that this might be the kind of 
peaceful world Brother was speaking of.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:25.140
I shall quietly pass my time here.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.950
A "peaceful world," huh?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:36.710
Some are unhappy that Ieyasu 
has become the shogun.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:41.730
That peaceful world might still 
be some way off, you know?

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:47.220
If the Toyotomi and Tokugawa 
clans were to fight again,

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.340
what would you do?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:55.480
I shall never take up arms again.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.980
Worried about Yukimura?

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.740
Do you think that Lord Yukimura has changed?

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.030
I'm glad his life was spared,

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:17.970
but it seems he's lost his purpose.

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:21.000
And now, he's even turned his back on 
his memories with Lord Mitsunari.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.830
He fought his brother, lost his friend,

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.590
and had his life spared by his enemy, Ieyasu.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.010
But he cannot live as a warrior anymore.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:37.730
It's only natural that he would lose his way.

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.360
Aren't you Yukimura's ninja?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.520
Then you have to believe in him.

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.580
Lady Nene...

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.780
I'll leave this with you.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.790
Right now, even seeing this probably hurts him,

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:01.130
but if Yukimura is ever able to look back 
fondly on his memories of Mitsunari,

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.090
give it to him then.

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:04.410
Yes.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:14.870
That's impossible!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.810
Wait up... Hey!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.020
Don't be stupid!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.060
That's the girl from this afternoon.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.570
What's wrong?

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.690
She suddenly came down with a high fever.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.380
What's all this ruckus?

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:34.920
W-Well...

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.300
I wanted to take her to a doctor.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.410
This village doesn't have one!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:42.040
I'll take her to the village at the 
foot of the mountain!

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:45.070
It'll take an entire day to reach the base.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.940
The kid won't last that long.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.510
I can get there by dawn if I go 
straight down the valley!

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:52.270
Don't be ridiculous! That's an animal trail!

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:53.840
People can't use it.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.010
You'll lose your footing and 
end up killing the both of you.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.340
But...

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.100
I will take her!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:06.060
Yukimura Sanada, you are forbidden 
from leaving this village!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.030
You'll be punished severely if you break the rules.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.540
It doesn't matter!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.100
There's a doctor in the village at the base, right?

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.080
Yes.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:20.080
I'll see to it that her life is saved.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.370
Lord Yukimura,

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.540
I'll go instead.

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:25.790
Carrying a child would be too 
dangerous, even for you.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:28.280
H-Halt!

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:30.090
We won't allow you to leave the village!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.660
A child's life is at stake.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.090
You will let me pass.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.820
Why, you...

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.640
Get back... You'd better—

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:38.890
I refuse!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.560
Lord Yukimura!

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:52.550
Please save Suzu's life!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.240
What's going on?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.620
Yukimura S-Sanada has fled!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.240
You fools! What were you doing?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.580
Hang in there.

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.220
Just a while longer.

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.080
<i>I'll save you, no matter what.</i>

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:34.900
What's wrong?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.880
Get a hold of yourself!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.660
Where did you come from?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.820
Don't worry.

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.760
I'll save you!

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:50.030
Hang in there.

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.100
Just a while longer.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.920
<i>Lord Yukimura!</i>

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.100
Lord Yukimura!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:07.640
Use this.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:29.120
Kanetsugu, you've made your 
decision, have you not?

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.370
Yes.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.380
We shall go to Yonezawa.

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:34.870
Sir!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.620
Who goes there?

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.480
Halt!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.070
It's Yukimura Sanada!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.420
After him!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.320
Stop!

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:07.830
Lord Yukimura!

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:09.830
This way!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.000
What's the matter?

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.050
Please help her.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.880
She has a high fever.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.260
You're...

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:26.050
You came all the way here for her?

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.540
Leave her to me!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:29.440
Thank you.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.390
There he is!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.620
Lord Yukimura!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.090
I won't resist!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:57.410
Welcome back, Lord Nobuyuki.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.840
Sorry to have worried you.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.190
Don't be.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:30.160
Thank you all for coming, men.

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:36.170
I have decided to relinquish the post 
of shogun to my son, Hidetada.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:39.770
<i>What about the Toyotomi clan?</i>

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:41.460
<i>What of Lord Hideyori?</i>

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:49.320
Moving forward, I'd like you all to do your best 
under Hidetada, the second Tokugawa shogun.

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.470
Yes, sir!

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:56.030
<i>It's too soon.</i>

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:58.690
<i>This will surely spur the Toyotomi clan to action.</i>

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:05.210
<i>Yukimura might get dragged into battle yet again!</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.200
Finally, this day has come!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.370
Shogun Hidetada Tokugawa!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.630
I am the greatest man in all the land!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.880
Y-Yukimura?

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:37.010
Curse you, Yukimura Sanada.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:38.980
I can't leave him alive!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.360
I can't! I won't!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:56.370
<i>There's only one thing I can do 
to protect Tokugawa's world.</i>

00:23:41.890 --> 00:23:45.150
Sengoku Musou 
High School

00:23:41.890 --> 00:23:45.150
6th Period

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:49.960
Please have this, Lord Nobuyuki.

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:51.820
Thank you, Ina.

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:53.830
I'm so jealous.

00:23:53.830 --> 00:23:55.070
Here, Masanori.

00:23:55.510 --> 00:23:56.450
Thanks!

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:58.080
You have some, too, Kiyomasa!

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:03.050
How stupid.

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:05.840
My lord...

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:08.070
Here.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:09.880
<i>To Be Continued</i>

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:24.800
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:13.470
The next visitor is a warrior clad in crimson armor.

00:24:13.690 --> 00:24:16.510
Seeking a purpose to his existence,

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:19.310
the blade of a man's soul will cut through flames.

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:21.770
What will the men see at the end of their battle?

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:24.800
<i>Episode Seven 
The Crimson Blade</i>

00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:24.710
Next time: "The Crimson Blade."
